msgid "Independent finite UART and SPI DMA controllers"
msgstr "独立的有限 UART 与 SPI DMA 控制器"

msgid ""
"The existing typed faces, shared immutable operations tables and caller-"
"owned request/state storage remain authoritative. A cold instance selects "
"one exact reviewed register/IRQ/DMA tuple. There is no stream allocator, "
"runtime registry, extra mutable route pointer or hidden copy pool. The "
"mutable DMA state layout is unchanged; the additional routes consume only "
"selected instances."
msgstr ""
"既有类型化接口面、共享不可变方法表及调用方持有的请求／状态存储仍是权威合同。冷态实例选择一组精确审阅的寄存器／IRQ／DMA 事实。没有 stream "
"分配器、运行时注册表、额外可变路由指针或隐藏复制池。可变 DMA 状态布局不变；新增路由只消耗所选实例资源。"

