msgid ""
"Reviewed silicon AFs are USART2/USART1 PA2/PA3 AF7, SPI2 PB13/PB14/PB15 AF5,"
" and SPI0 PA5/PA6/PA7 AF5. These facts do not supply external Board wiring, "
"connectors, electrical pull-ups or qualification. Typed configuration "
"remains the single assembly authority. The second UART TX conflicts with the"
" first I2C TX engine and must be rejected in resource resolution. GD literal"
" DMA0/1 is distinct from public opaque controller IDs 1/2."
msgstr ""
"已审阅硅片 AF 为 USART2/USART1 PA2/PA3 AF7、SPI2 PB13/PB14/PB15 AF5 和 SPI0 "
"PA5/PA6/PA7 AF5。这些事实不提供外部 Board 接线、连接器、电气上拉或资格。类型化配置保持唯一装配权威。第二 UART TX 与首个 "
"I2C TX 引擎冲突，必须在资源解析时拒绝。GD 原始 DMA0/1 与公共不透明控制器 ID 1/2 不同。"

msgid ""
"STM UART initialization uses retained exact IRQ, DMA, stream and clock "
"facts. STM SPI initialization validates the selected bus, clock and engine "
"pointers; an idle bus whose DMA vectors remain enabled cannot be acquired by"
" another cold object. GD cold `_initialize_at` methods select only the two "
"maintained readonly controller descriptors. Existing primary initializers "
"remain thin wrappers. Duplicate/live hardware, retained enabled DMA "
"publishers and unsupported tuples reject before effects. A disabled engine "
"still has an owner while its vector lease is enabled; cold acquisition "
"preserves that owner's flags/priority."
msgstr ""
"STM UART 初始化使用保留的精确 IRQ、DMA、stream 与时钟事实。STM SPI 初始化校验所选总线、时钟与引擎指针；即使总线空闲，只要"
" DMA 向量仍使能，就不能由另一个冷态对象取得。GD 冷态 `_initialize_at` "
"只选择两组维护中的只读控制器描述符，原首控制器初始化器仍是薄包装。重复／活动硬件、保留的已使能 DMA "
"发布者及不支持组合均在效果发生前拒绝。引擎关闭但向量租约仍使能时仍有所有者；冷态取得保持该所有者的标志与优先级。"

msgid ""
"Finite DMA completion is independent from wire completion. Hot W1C clears "
"only observed completion/half-completion bits; fresh error bits remain "
"latched. The provider reads errors after actual engine withdrawal and again "
"before settlement. It never reports success after a detected DMA error. Both"
" engines, IRQ sources and SPI wire must drain before CS release and SETTLED;"
" UART also requires true TC. Failed withdrawal retains QUARANTINED requests "
"and buffers. Peer flags, clocks, vectors, CS and loans remain independent. "
"Shared DMA clock ownership belongs to outer assembly and is never released "
"by an individual stop."
msgstr ""
"有限 DMA 完成独立于线侧完成。热路径 W1C "
"只清除已观察完成／半完成位，保留新错误位锁存。提供者在实际引擎撤销后及最终完成发布前再次读取错误，检测到 DMA 错误后绝不报告成功。SPI 释放 CS"
" 与发布 SETTLED 前必须排空两个引擎、IRQ 源与线侧；UART 还需真实 TC。撤销失败保留 QUARANTINED "
"请求与缓冲区。对等实例的标志、时钟、向量、CS 与借用相互独立。共享 DMA 时钟归外层装配所有，单实例停止不释放它。"

msgid ""
"Explicit SPI fixed-memory flags preserve caller-owned dummy/discard scalar "
"storage, exact one-byte DMA domains and MINC identity. There is no implicit "
"scratch fallback. STM SPI2 polling abort/recovery pulses APB1 SPI2 reset; it"
" does not reset the neighboring APB2 SPI1 controller."
msgstr ""
"显式 SPI 固定内存标志保留调用方持有的 dummy/discard 标量存储、精确单字节 DMA 域及 MINC 身份；没有隐式临时存储回退。STM"
" SPI2 轮询中止／恢复只脉冲 APB1 SPI2 复位，不复位邻近 APB2 SPI1 控制器。"

msgid ""
"Only finite second-controller UART TX/SPI DMA is implemented here. Existing "
"primary receive modes remain covered by their own suites; secondary "
"continuous RX is not admitted through these new facts. Actual "
"GoogleTest/GoogleMock MMIO regressions and strict ARM SDK object/layout "
"reports are development evidence. Factory/selected whole-image validation is"
" recorded separately. Physical DMA, IRQ latency, CS/wire timing and Board "
"HIL remain **not executed**."
msgstr ""
"本页只实现第二控制器的有限 UART TX／SPI DMA。首控制器既有接收模式由各自测试覆盖；新增事实不接纳第二控制器连续 RX。真实 "
"GoogleTest/GoogleMock MMIO 回归和严格 ARM SDK "
"对象／布局报告属于开发证据；factory／所选完整镜像验证另行记录。物理 DMA、IRQ 延迟、CS／线侧时序与 Board HIL "
"均**未执行**。"
